# Line-ending policy.
#
# The repository stores LF for text files; Windows-only entry points are
# checked out with CRLF so cmd.exe and PowerShell are never surprised.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets (fonts / test images / compiled shaders)
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.png binary
*.spv binary
